:"2026-05-19","text":"Referred to the House Committee on Energy and Commerce."},"laws":[],"number":"8907","originChamber":"House","policyArea":"Health","sponsors":[{"bioguideId":"S001145","district":9,"fullName":"Rep. Schakowsky, Janice D. [D-IL-9]","party":"D","state":"IL"}],"summaries":[{"actionDate":"2026-05-19","actionDesc":"Introduced in House","text":"<p><strong>Innovative Maternal Payment and Coverage To Save Moms Act or the IMPACT to Save Moms Act</strong></p><p>This bill requires the Centers for Medicare &amp; Medicaid Services to establish the Perinatal Care Alternative Payment Model Demonstration Project through FY2031 to allow states to test payment models for maternity care, including postpartum care, under Medicaid and the Children's Health Insurance Program (CHIP).&nbsp;</p>","updateDate":"2026-06-29T19:30:07Z","versionCode":"00"}],"title":"IMPACT to Save Moms Act","type":"hr","updateDate":"2026-08-21T18:50:46Z","updateDateIncludingText":"2026-08-21T18:50:46Z"}
